  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Covenant Is Broken",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the word that came to Jeremiah from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.11.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.11.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ":",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Listen to the terms of this covenant and tell them to the people of Judah and to those who live in Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell them that this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.11.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.11.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, says: 'Cursed is the one who does not obey the terms of this covenant—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the terms I commanded your ancestors when I brought them out of Egypt, out of the iron-smelting furnace.' I said, 'Obey me and do everything I command you, and you will be my people, and I will be your God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I will fulfill the oath I swore to your ancestors, to give them a land flowing with milk and honey'—the land you possess today.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JER 11:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I answered, \"Amen,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.11.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.11.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.11.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.11.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to me, \"Proclaim all these words in the towns of Judah and in the streets of Jerusalem: 'Listen to the terms of this covenant and follow them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the time I brought your ancestors up from Egypt until today, I warned them again and again, saying, \"Obey me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they did not listen or pay attention; instead, they followed the stubbornness of their evil hearts. So I brought on them all the curses of the covenant I had commanded them to follow but that they did not keep.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.11.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.11.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to me, \"There is a conspiracy among the people of Judah and those who live in Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have returned to the sins of their ancestors, who refused to listen to my words. They have followed other gods to serve them. Both Israel and Judah have broken the covenant I made with their ancestors.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.11.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.11.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: 'I will bring on them a disaster they cannot escape. Although they cry out to me, I will not listen to them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The towns of Judah and the people of Jerusalem will go and cry out to the gods to whom they burn incense, but they will not help them at all when disaster strikes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You, Judah, have as many gods as you have towns; and the altars you have set up to burn incense to that shameful god Baal are as many as the streets of Jerusalem.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Do not pray for this people or offer any plea or petition for them, because I will not listen when they call to me in the time of their distress.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"What is my beloved doing in my temple",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 11:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "as she, with many others, works out her evil schemes?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 11:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Can consecrated meat avert your punishment?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 11:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "When you engage in your wickedness,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 11:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "then you rejoice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.11.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.11.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "called you a thriving olive tree",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 11:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "with fruit beautiful in form.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 11:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "But with the roar of a mighty storm",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 11:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he will set it on fire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 11:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and its branches will be broken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.11.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.11.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty, who planted you, has decreed disaster for you, because the people of both Israel and Judah have done evil and aroused my anger by burning incense to Baal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Plot Against Jeremiah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.11.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.11.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "revealed their plot to me, I knew it, for at that time he showed me what they were doing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I had been like a gentle lamb led to the slaughter; I did not realize that they had plotted against me, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.19"
